1313
01:30:10,401 --> 01:30:12,166
Yeah. Yeah, yeah.
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ, ແມ່ນແລ້ວ.

1314
01:30:12,301 --> 01:30:13,838
Ah.
ອາ.

1315
01:30:13,974 --> 01:30:17,008
I mean, I have a 20-foot
climbing wall in my gym, so...
